window.bookSummaryJSON = "Elizabeth Bear is a rising name in science fiction. In <i>Undertow</i>, André Deschênes wants to escape his life as a hired assassin. He hopes to learn the art of conjuring, manipulating the odds of people's lives. But a revolution is brewing in the city of Novo Haven, where an alien race is finally gaining ground, demanding they be treated as citizens. And before André moves on, he has a contract to fulfill."; 
